  "cited_article_id": "configure-roles-and-permissions",
  "reply": "1. Open **Settings > Practice Staff > Roles & Permissions** (only practice managers or primary admins can edit security). 2. Click **Create New Role** or pick an existing role. 3. Toggle the needed permissions (e.g., Billing, Patient Charts, System Settings). 4. Click **Assign Users**, select your new medical assistant (and any other staff), then **Save Changes**. 5. Ensure the user’s account is active; if the menu still doesn’t appear, have them clear their browser cache and log in again. Remember each active user must have at least one role and you cannot set permissions directly on individual accounts."
}
